Use DataDict.pkg

Open OidcClient
Open OidcAuthorizationCode
Open OidcCallbackURL
Open OidcClientScopes
Open OidcRevokedRefreshToken

Class cOidcClientDataDictionary is a DataDictionary
    
    Procedure Construct_Object
        Forward Send Construct_Object
        Set Main_File to OidcClient.File_Number

        Set Add_Client_File to OidcAuthorizationCode.File_Number
        Set Add_Client_File to OidcCallbackURL.File_Number
        Set Add_Client_File to OidcClientScopes.File_Number
        Set Add_Client_File to OidcRevokedRefreshToken.File_Number

        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_KEYFIELD DD_NOPUT to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_KEYFIELD DD_FINDREQ to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_INDEXFIELD DD_NOPUT to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_DEFAULT DD_DISPLAYONLY to True

    End_Procedure
    
    Procedure Creating
        Forward Send Creating
        Move (CurrentDateTime()) to OidcClient.CreatedAt
    End_Procedure
End_Class